1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,538
For our final task, Mira and I wrote a letter to our future selves.

2
00:00:04,488 --> 00:00:10,659
We drew the atmosphere, hydrosphere and lithosphere, then marked our village’s longitude and latitude.

3
00:00:10,659 --> 00:00:14,590
Beyond a plain stood a plateau where our first adventure had begun.

4
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:19,999
Weather changes every day,’ I wrote, ‘but climate describes patterns over many years.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,977
A chill made me shiver.

6
00:00:21,977 --> 00:00:26,193
My hands began to tremble, so we moved inside to finish the letter.

